# Intermediates from tools/prepare.sh live in /tmp, not here.

# IMPORTANT — if this repo is ever public, do NOT commit stems separated from
# the real M83 recording. Academic use of the track in a demo is one thing;
# publishing the separated audio is distributing the recording. Either keep the
# repo private, or uncomment the next line before adding the real stems.
# content/panel-01/stems/

# Real separated stems — commercial recordings.
# Keeping them out of history by default: pushing them to a PUBLIC repo
# distributes the recordings, and git history is not easily undone.
# To include them (see README → Publishing with real audio), delete these lines.
content/*/stems/
STEMS/
